u2019s training now, by choosing among ATS\u2019 s already implemented scenarios or by requesting your own tailored pipeline.\nCurrent version includes Mass Casualty Incident: First Responders, Mass Violence Event: Health Workforce Preparedness and others.\n\nBe the Hero people deserve.\nBe prepared with ATS.", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "The ATS Hero application offers the opportunity for professionals in the field of medicine, emergency and rescue services, to get trained on the latest techniques and increase their preparedness from the comfort of their own home. The ATS complete solution provides an engaging, highly interactive, and fully immersive VR environment for remote and mobile training in a variety of response protocols including but not limited to START Triage, SALT Triage, de-escalation tactics, amongst many other evidence-based strategies. Accompanied by the ATS online Platform, you have a complete overview of your team\u2019s performance and engagement, on an individual and collective level. Take control of the intensity and the methodology of your team\u2019s training now, by choosing among ATS\u2019 s already implemented scenarios or by requesting your own tailored pipeline.\nCurrent version includes Mass Casualty Incident: First Responders, Mass Violence Event: Health Workforce Preparedness and others.\n\nBe the Hero people deserve.\nBe prepared with ATS.", "genre_names": ["Learning", "Medical"], "has_in_app_ads": false, "id": "3672053749550124", "is_approved": false, "is_concept": false, "is_enterprise_enabled": false, "organization": {"id": "", "is_authorized_for_quest": false, "application_groupings": {"count": 0, "nodes": [], "__typename": "", "typename_enum": 0}}, "platform": "", "publisher_name": "Augmented Training Systems", "required_space_adjusted": 4991610211, "requiredSpaceAdjustedFormatted": "4.65 GB", "total_installed_space": 2713884088, "totalInstalledSpaceFormatted": "2.53 GB", "quality_rating_aggregate": 0, "img": "", "